s deliver rich bass, clear vocals, and balanced stereo sound. Dual ENC microphones with AI noise reduction help reduce up to 98% of background noise, making calls clearer at work, outdoors, or while commuting.","Trusted by 100,000+ Customers & 3-Year Care: Chosen by over 100,000 customers worldwide, these headphones are built for reliable everyday performance. Every purchase includes our official 3-Year Care support for added peace of mind.","Up to 40H Playtime with LED Display：Enjoy up to 8 hours of playtime on a single charge and up to 40 hours with the charging case. The built-in LED battery display lets you check remaining power anytime, while a 10-minute quick charge gives up to 2 hours of playback.","Smart Touchscreen Case for Easy Control：Our wireless earbuds come with a smart touchscreen charging case, allowing you to control music, volume, calls, EQ modes, camera, and earbud location with a simple tap or swipe. No need to open your phone for everyday adjustments.","Lightweight Fit & IPX7 Waterproof for Small Ears：Designed for small ears, each earbud weighs only 3.2g with an ergonomic in-ear shape and multiple ear tip sizes for a secure, comfortable fit. IPX7 waterproof protection helps resist sweat and splashes during workouts, running, commuting, or rainy days."],"review_summary":"; ; Brand Bucephalus Color Orange Ear Placement In Ear Form Factor In Ear Impedance 32 ohm","pros":["Innovative smart touchscreen case allows easy playback control","Impressive 40-hour total playtime with fast Bluetooth 6.0 connectivity","IPX7 waterproof rating offers full protection during intense workouts"],"cons":["Vibrant orange colorway may not appeal to minimalists","Touchscreen case adds slight bulk compared to standard charging cases"],"root_gallery":"{https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yqHyQfKjL.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41O7XkGP7qL.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51iZQtLEA1L.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511elR+8C2L.jpg,https://m.media